id: dedicated-watcher
name: Dedicated Watcher
talentCategory: racial
race: shinjin
prerequisites: Shinjin
description: >
  As a non-combatant yourself, you find the greatest success in helping others reach their fullest potential.
text: >
  Dedicated Watcher: As a non-combatant yourself, you find the greatest success in helping others reach their fullest potential.
  –Prerequisites: Shinjin
  (1)-[Passive]: For the 1st effect of the Spectator State, you may target an additional Ally.
  (2)-[Triggered]: While you are in the Spectator State, if an Ally makes an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a Counter Action to increase their Strike and Wound Rolls by 1(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.
  (3)-[Triggered]: While you are in the Spectator State, if an Ally is targeted by an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a Counter Action to increase their Defense Value and Soak Value by 1(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) The Spectator State's Cheer asked twice - a second Ally, or none (chat.mjs spectatorCheer).
allow watcher.extraAlly;
# (2), (3) In the Spectator State: buttons on an Ally's attack's card, or one aimed at an Ally - a Counter Action each, 1(T) of
# yours, once an attack each (chat.mjs observationButtons).
allow watcher.attack;
allow watcher.defend;
